From 1359a6325456e20907088c5ca61e324a313e3b04 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kingD2N <114895723+kingD2N@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 04:10:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Launcher3: swipe up past a threshold to open the app as a
 bubble

Swipe up from an app and keep dragging. Past the chosen distance the
phone vibrates once; releasing there sends the launcher home and opens
the app as an app bubble instead.

Home settings get a switch (off by default) and the swipe distance
(45-80% of the screen height, default 60%). The gesture stays off when
the shell cannot create app bubbles.
